-+# Task 16 report
-+
-+Status: COMPLETE.
-+
-+Commit: (recorded below after `git commit`).
-+
-+Tests: `uv run pytest` — 1795 passed + 2 xfailed (baseline 1792 + 2, three new tests added). `uv run
